---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
---
<Base
  title="Quire — Rust engines for Office documents"
  description="Quire is a Rust library for DOCX: open, lay out, render, and save back with untouched ZIP entries returned byte-for-byte. Layout runs on real font metrics with Knuth-Plass line breaking; one core compiles to native and wasm."
  path="/"
>
<div class="quire-home">
  <!-- ══ HERO：三層紙堆（bytes / breaks / page），滾動壓平 ══ -->
  <section class="hero-d dark-sec" id="hero">
    <div class="rain" aria-hidden="true" id="rain"></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker-row">
          <p class="kicker"><b>●</b> Rust library · DOCX today · XLSX in progress</p>
          <a class="kicker-gh" href="https://github.com/quire-office" rel="me">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27s1.36.09 2 .27c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A7.995 7.995 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8Z"/>
            </svg>
            GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
        <h1>A document in, the <span class="lit">same document</span> out.</h1>
        <div class="lede">
          <p>Quire opens a <code>.docx</code>, lays it out from real font metrics, and renders it —
            and when it saves, anything it didn't modify goes back byte-for-byte. CI checks that
            second part on 399 real files.</p>
          <p lang="zh-Hant">Quire 開啟 <code>.docx</code>、以真實字型度量排版、輸出渲染結果；存回時，
            引擎沒改動的部分會位元組級原樣寫回——這件事由 CI 在 399 份真實檔案上逐檔驗證。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn" href="/playground">Playground <span class="cta-note">in progress</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/quire-office" rel="me">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/roadmap">Read the roadmap</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack-zone" id="stackZone">
        <div class="scene" id="scene">
          <div class="tilt" id="tilt">
            <div class="plane p-bytes" data-p="bytes"><div class="card" id="bytesCard"></div>
              <span class="chip">bytes · untouched ZIP entries</span></div>
            <div class="plane p-lines" data-p="lines"><div class="card" id="linesCard"></div>
              <span class="chip">model · KP break points</span></div>
            <div class="plane p-type" data-p="type"><div class="card">
              <div class="hd">quire / specimen</div>
              <p lang="zh-Hant">存回時，引擎未觸碰的每一個位元組都原樣出現；這條性質由 roundtrip --check 逐檔檢查。</p>
              <p>The browser tab and the desktop run the same layout core: same advances, same breaks, same display list.</p>
              <p class="red">¶ break points are golden-tested</p>
              <p>Everything you see is a rendering target: display lists out, pixels in.</p>
            </div><span class="chip">display list · your page</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-cue" id="cue">scroll to press the sheet<i></i></div>
    <p class="stack-hint" aria-hidden="true">拖曳轉動 · 點擊翻開 · ←→ 換頁</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ pipeline：sticky rail ＋ SVG 描線 ══ -->
  <div class="wrap pipe" id="pipe">
    <div class="pipe-sticky">
      <h2>The pipeline.</h2>
      <p>Three stages, one Rust core, compiled twice. Each stage computes once —
        browser and desktop draw from the same numbers.</p>
      <div class="rail" id="rail"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe-flow">
      <section class="stage">
        <span class="tag">Stage 01 · parse</span><h3>Every ZIP entry is kept, even the ones we ignore</h3>
        <p>The OPC container is unzipped entry by entry. Parts the engine understands become
          models; everything else — customXml, unknown extensions — is held in raw bytes and
          written back unchanged.</p>
        <figure class="fig"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 150" role="img" aria-label="ZIP parts claimed and held byte-for-byte"><g class="draw">
          <rect class="dl" x="10" y="40" width="120" height="70"/><text class="ln" x="30" y="80">.docx zip</text>
          <path class="dl" d="M140 75 h60 m-12 -8 l12 8 -12 8"/>
          <rect class="dl" x="215" y="10" width="150" height="32"/><text class="ln" x="228" y="31">document.xml ✓</text>
          <rect class="dl" x="215" y="50" width="150" height="32"/><text class="ln" x="228" y="71">styles.xml ✓</text>
          <rect class="dl dl-red" x="215" y="90" width="150" height="32"/><text class="ln" x="228" y="111">customXml/ ✓ untouched</text>
          <path class="dl" d="M380 75 h60 m-12 -8 l12 8 -12 8"/>
          <rect class="dl" x="455" y="40" width="160" height="70"/>
          <text class="ln" x="470" y="70">held byte-for-byte</text><text class="ln" x="470" y="88">for write-back</text>
        </g></svg></figure>
      </section>
      <section class="stage">
        <span class="tag">Stage 02 · shape + break</span><h3>Real metrics, Knuth–Plass optimum</h3>
        <p>Text is measured against real font outlines; break points are chosen per paragraph to
          minimise total badness (Knuth–Plass), with UAX#14 deciding which breaks are legal at all.
          Output is locked by golden snapshots, so regressions show up as diffs.</p>
        <figure class="fig"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 150" role="img" aria-label="Greedy versus Knuth-Plass badness curves"><g class="draw">
          <path class="dl" d="M10 120 C 90 120 120 40 200 40 S 320 110 400 70 560 30 630 20"/>
          <path class="dl dl-red" d="M10 130 C 110 130 130 90 210 95 S 330 130 410 105 570 60 630 55"/>
          <circle class="dotred" cx="200" cy="40" r="5"/><circle class="dotred" cx="400" cy="70" r="5"/>
          <text class="ln" x="188" y="24">{"break"}</text><text class="ln" x="388" y="54">{"break"}</text>
          <text class="ln" x="10" y="145">greedy per-line vs KP per-paragraph</text>
        </g></svg></figure>
      </section>
      <section class="stage">
        <span class="tag">Stage 03 · paginate</span><h3>One keystroke ≠ re-paginate the chapter</h3>
        <p>Paragraph caches reflow only the dirty interval; breaks settle in background passes.
          p95 incremental reflow under 8 ms. Output: a display list both renderers draw from.</p>
        <figure class="fig"><svg viewBox="0 0 640 150" role="img" aria-label="Dirty-interval reflow into a display list"><g class="draw">
          <rect class="dl" x="20" y="20" width="80" height="110"/><rect class="dl" x="115" y="20" width="80" height="110"/>
          <rect class="dl dl-red" x="210" y="20" width="80" height="110"/>
          <text class="ln" x="34" y="145">cached</text><text class="ln" x="129" y="145">cached</text>
          <text class="ln" x="212" y="145">dirty → reflow</text>
          <path class="dl dl-red" d="M305 75 h60 m-12 -8 l12 8 -12 8"/>
          <rect class="dl" x="380" y="35" width="240" height="80"/>
          <text class="ln" x="398" y="65">{"display list: {text, rect, line}"}</text>
          <text class="ln" x="398" y="85">→ native renderer · → wasm canvas</text>
        </g></svg></figure>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══ 断行劇場：scrub 逐行排版 ══ -->
  <section class="theatre" id="theatre"><div class="theatre-sticky"><div class="wrap theatre-inner">
    <div class="proof">
      <p class="kicker2">The <em>line-break demo</em> — scroll to set the type</p>
      <h2>One paragraph, one optimum.</h2>
      <div class="galley" id="galley"></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="proof-side">
      <p class="kicker2">What you're watching</p>
      <p>Knuth–Plass picks break points that minimise total badness across the paragraph — not one
        greedy line at a time. Red ticks are accepted breaks; the figure is that line's badness
        (0 = perfect). Hover any line to inspect it. <span lang="zh-Hant">邊捲動，邊看斷點怎麼選。</span></p>
      <div class="stat">accepted breaks · <b id="brkCount">0</b></div>
    </aside>
  </div></div></section>

  <!-- ══ Evidence counters ══ -->
  <section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="evidence-h" style="padding-top:4.5rem">
    <h2 id="evidence-h"><span class="sec-no" aria-hidden="true">§ 01</span> Checked numbers</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat" data-reveal>
        <span class="num"><span id="c399">399</span>/399</span>
        <span class="lbl">real-world corpus files round-trip byte-identical in CI — ZIP64 and unknown extensions included</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat" data-reveal>
        <span class="num">2 OS × 2 targets</span>
        <span class="lbl">the same gates run on ubuntu and Windows, each building native + wasm32-unknown-unknown (a macOS job exists but is paused for now)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat" data-reveal>
        <span class="num">&lt; 54 KB</span>
        <span class="lbl">gzipped first wasm payload — the size budget is a CI gate; CRDT collaboration code lives in a deferred chunk</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ Reflow lab ══ -->
  <section class="lab dark-sec" id="lab"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>Reflow lab — drag it.</h2>
    <p class="sub">A feel for what reflow costs: the text here is laid out by CSS, not the engine —
      the point is the interaction, not the numbers.
      <span lang="zh-Hant">拉動滑桿感受版面重排；這段用 CSS 排版，不是引擎本身。</span></p>
    <div class="lab-frame"><div class="lab-text" id="labtext" lang="zh-Hant">一個 Office 檔案是數千個宣告的容器。引擎未觸碰的每一個宣告、每一條 ZIP entry、每一個位元組，都會在寫回時原樣出現；這條性質由 roundtrip --check 逐檔檢查。瀏覽器分頁與桌面共用同一個排版核心：相同的整形 advance、相同的最佳化斷點、相同的 display list，不會出現兩邊算出不同答案的情形。</div></div>
    <div class="controls">
      <label class="ctrl">measure
        <input type="range" id="lw" min="26" max="100" value="100" aria-label="text measure percent"> %</label>
      <label class="ctrl">size
        <input type="range" id="ls" min="14" max="26" value="17" aria-label="font size pixels"> px</label>
      <div class="lab-meta" id="lmeta"></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <!-- ══ formats ══ -->
  <section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="formats-h">
    <h2 id="formats-h"><span class="sec-no" aria-hidden="true">§ 02</span> One lossless core, three document formats</h2>
    <div class="formats">
      <article class="fmt" data-reveal>
        <div class="fmt-tag"><span>DOCX</span><span class="fmt-state now">Now</span></div>
        <h3>Flow</h3>
        <p>Lossless round-trip plus the line-breaking and pagination pipeline — everything the playground runs on.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fmt" data-reveal>
        <div class="fmt-tag"><span>XLSX</span><span class="fmt-state now">In progress</span></div>
        <h3>Grid</h3>
        <p>Same OPC/lossless layer as DOCX. Workbook model and cell parsing come first; formula engine after.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fmt" data-reveal>
        <div class="fmt-tag"><span>PPTX</span><span class="fmt-state">Planned</span></div>
        <h3>Canvas</h3>
        <p>Slide and shape model reusing the layout and shaping crates; its own presentation render list.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.95rem;">
      Shared between the three: the OPC container handling and the byte-level round-trip
      guarantees. Not shared: the layout model — DOCX flows, XLSX grids, PPTX places boxes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ principles ══ -->
  <section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="principles-h">
    <h2 id="principles-h"><span class="sec-no" aria-hidden="true">§ 03</span> What CI enforces</h2>
    <div class="rows">
      <div class="row" data-reveal>
        <div class="k">Untouched bytes come back identical</div>
        <p>The ZIP layer copies entries it didn't modify byte-for-byte; <code>roundtrip --check</code> diffs that against a 399-file corpus on every commit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row" data-reveal>
        <div class="k">One core, two targets</div>
        <p>The engine compiles to native and <code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code>. The browser shell is a thin platform adapter, not a second implementation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row" data-reveal>
        <div class="k">Layering, checked by script</div>
        <p>Format crates never import shells; shells enter through one engine API. <code>check-layering.sh</code> runs in CI, so the boundary doesn't depend on review memory.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row" data-reveal>
        <div class="k">Real typesetting</div>
        <p>Shaped advances against real font metrics, Knuth-Plass optimal breaks, incremental pagination with p95 reflow under 8 ms (benchmarked in-repo).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ availability ══ -->
  <section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="waitlist-h">
    <h2 id="waitlist-h"><span class="sec-no" aria-hidden="true">§ 04</span> What you can use today</h2>
    <p>
      The engine is licensed Apache-2.0 and the repository is currently private: the code,
      the 399-file corpus and the CI gates exist and run, but a public checkout is pending
      the release decision — write to
      <a href="mailto:preview@quireoffice.dev">preview@quireoffice.dev</a> for access.
      The browser playground is being wired to the wasm build: the drop zone exists but
      doesn't render yet, and that page says so. A hosted editor is further out — XLSX
      groundwork and the collaborative layer come first.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
</Base>

<script>
import { gsap } from 'gsap';
import { ScrollTrigger } from 'gsap/ScrollTrigger';
gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

const RM = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
const $ = (s) => document.querySelector(s);

/* ── byte rain ── */
const rain = $('#rain');
if (rain) {
  let html = '';
  for (let i = 0; i < 130; i++) {
    let l = '';
    for (let j = 0; j < 8; j++) l += ((Math.random() * 256) | 0).toString(16).toUpperCase().padStart(2, '0') + ' ';
    html += '<span>' + l + '</span>';
  }
  rain.innerHTML = html;
  if (!RM) gsap.to(rain, { y: -140, duration: 38, ease: 'none', repeat: -1 });
}

/* ── bytes / lines 紙面內容 ── */
const bytesCard = $('#bytesCard');
if (bytesCard) {
  let h = '';
  for (let i = 0; i < 24; i++) {
    let l = '';
    for (let j = 0; j < 9; j++) {
      const b = ((Math.random() * 256) | 0).toString(16).toUpperCase().padStart(2, '0');
      l += Math.random() < 0.045 ? '<span class="r">' + b + '</span>' : (Math.random() < 0.14 ? '<b>' + b + '</b>' : b);
    }
    h += l + '<br>';
  }
  bytesCard.innerHTML = '<b>word/document.xml</b><br>' + h + 'customXml/item1.xml … <span class="r">untouched</span>';
}
const linesCard = $('#linesCard');
if (linesCard) {
  let h = '';
  for (let i = 1; i <= 8; i++) {
    h += '<div class="ln" style="top:' + (i * 10.5) + '%;left:8%;right:8%"></div>' +
         '<div class="tick" style="top:calc(' + (i * 10.5) + '% - 1px);right:' + (8 + ((i * 13) % 22)) + '%;width:16px"></div>';
  }
  linesCard.innerHTML = h;
}

/* ── 3D 紙堆：正面朝前＋進場發牌＋滑鼠視差＋拖曳軌道＋點擊聚焦 ── */
const scene = $('#scene'), hero = $('#hero'), cue = $('#cue'), stackZone = $('#stackZone');
if (scene) {
  const tilt = $('#tilt');
  const planes = [...scene.querySelectorAll('.plane')];
  const n = planes.length;
  const stack = { rx: 7, rz: -3, sep: 1 };              // 初始正面朝前，深淺靠 Z 距
  const home = { rx: 7, rz: -3 };
  const po = planes.map((_, i) => ({ fx: 0, fz: 0, s: 1, rz: 0, px: 0 })); // 每層可動畫狀態
  let focused = -1;

  const apply = () => {
    scene.style.transform = `rotateX(${stack.rx}deg) rotateZ(${stack.rz}deg)`;
    planes.forEach((pl, i) => {
      const p = po[i];
      pl.style.transform = `translate(-50%,-50%) translate3d(${p.fx + p.px}px,0,${i * stack.sep * 120 + p.fz}px) rotateZ(${p.rz}deg) scale(${p.s})`;
    });
  };
  const spread = () => (innerWidth < 900 ? 96 : 250);

  if (RM) {
    stack.rx = 5; stack.rz = 0; stack.sep = .35; apply();
    if (cue) cue.style.display = 'none';
  } else {
    /* 進場：三張紙像發牌一樣依次滑入堆疊 */
    apply();
    planes.forEach((pl, i) => {
      po[i].rz = (i - 1) * 9; po[i].fx = (i - 1) * spread() * .8;
      pl.style.opacity = '0'; apply();
      gsap.to(pl, { opacity: 1, duration: .5, delay: .15 + i * .16 });
      gsap.to(po[i], { rz: 0, fx: 0, duration: 1.1, delay: .15 + i * .16, ease: 'power3.out', onUpdate: apply });
    });
    /* 閒置呼吸：整堆極緩上下浮動，讓畫面活著 */
    gsap.to(stackZone, { y: 6, duration: 5.5, yoyo: true, repeat: -1, ease: 'sine.inOut', delay: 1.6 });

    /* 滾動壓平（招牌動作保留）：正面 → 完全貼合成一張 */
    gsap.to(stack, { rx: 0, rz: 0, sep: 0, duration: 1, ease: 'none',
      scrollTrigger: { trigger: hero, start: 'top top', end: 'bottom 30%', scrub: .55, onUpdate: (s) => {
        if (cue) cue.style.opacity = String(Math.max(0, 1 - s.progress * 1.6));
        apply();
      } } });

    /* 滑鼠視差：整堆輕微转向＋每層按深度差動（近層動得多＝真景深） */
    const qx = gsap.quickTo(tilt, 'rotationY', { duration: .6, ease: 'power3' });
    const qy = gsap.quickTo(tilt, 'rotationX', { duration: .6, ease: 'power3' });
    const qpx = po.map((p) => gsap.quickTo(p, 'px', { duration: .7, ease: 'power3', onUpdate: apply }));
    hero.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {
      if (e.pointerType !== 'mouse') return;
      const r = hero.getBoundingClientRect();
      const nx = (e.clientX - r.left) / r.width - .5, ny = (e.clientY - r.top) / r.height - .5;
      qx(nx * 12); qy(ny * -7);
      po.forEach((_, i) => qpx[i](nx * (i - (n - 1) / 2) * -26));
    });

    /* 拖曳軌道（僅滑鼠）：抓住紙堆轉，放手回彈到正面 */
    let drag = null;
    stackZone.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => {
      if (e.pointerType !== 'mouse' || focused >= 0) return;
      drag = { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY, rx: stack.rx, rz: stack.rz, moved: 0 };
      stackZone.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);
    });
    stackZone.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {
      if (!drag) return;
      const dx = e.clientX - drag.x, dy = e.clientY - drag.y;
      drag.moved = Math.max(drag.moved, Math.abs(dx) + Math.abs(dy));
      stack.rz = Math.max(-26, Math.min(14, drag.rz + dx * .13));
      stack.rx = Math.max(-6, Math.min(46, drag.rx - dy * .09));
      apply();
    });
    const release = () => {
      if (!drag) return;
      const wasDrag = drag.moved > 5; drag = null;
      if (wasDrag) { suppressClick = true; setTimeout(() => suppressClick = false, 0);
        gsap.to(stack, { rx: home.rx, rz: home.rz, duration: 1.1, ease: 'power2.out', onUpdate: apply }); }
    };
    stackZone.addEventListener('pointerup', release);
    stackZone.addEventListener('pointercancel', release);

    /* 點擊聚焦：選中那張升到正前方，其餘向兩側讓開；再點同一張或點空白回位 */
    let suppressClick = false;
    const setFocus = (idx) => {
      focused = (focused === idx) ? -1 : idx;
      const sp = spread();
      const others = [...Array(n).keys()].filter((i) => i !== idx);
      planes.forEach((pl, i) => {
        const p = po[i];
        if (focused < 0) gsap.to(p, { fx: 0, fz: 0, s: 1, duration: .8, ease: 'power3.out', onUpdate: apply });
        else if (i === idx) gsap.to(p, { fx: 0, fz: 300, s: 1.02, duration: .8, ease: 'power3.out', onUpdate: apply });
        else gsap.to(p, { fx: (others.indexOf(i) - (others.length - 1) / 2) * sp, fz: -40, s: .93,
          duration: .8, ease: 'power3.out', onUpdate: apply });
      });
    };
    planes.forEach((pl, i) => {
      pl.tabIndex = 0;
      pl.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        if (suppressClick) return;
        if (e.target.closest && e.target.closest('a')) return;
        setFocus(i);
      });
      pl.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => scene.setAttribute('data-focus', pl.dataset.p));
      pl.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => scene.removeAttribute('data-focus'));
    });
    stackZone.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (!e.target.closest('.plane') && focused >= 0) setFocus(focused); });
    /* 滾動開始時自動退回堆疊，避免聚焦態與壓平動畫打架 */
    let lastY = scrollY;
    addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      if (focused >= 0 && Math.abs(scrollY - lastY) > 4) setFocus(focused);
      lastY = scrollY;
    }, { passive: true });
    /* 鍵盤：Tab 進入後 ←→ 輪流聚焦、Esc 退出 */
    stackZone.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') { setFocus(focused < 0 ? 0 : (focused + 1) % n); e.preventDefault(); }
      else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') { setFocus(focused < 0 ? n - 1 : (focused - 1 + n) % n); e.preventDefault(); }
      else if (e.key === 'Escape' && focused >= 0) { setFocus(focused); e.preventDefault(); }
    });
  }
}

/* ── pipeline scroll-spy ＋ SVG 描線 ── */
const stages = [...document.querySelectorAll('.quire-home .stage')];
const rail = $('#rail');
if (rail && stages.length) {
  stages.forEach((st, i) => {
    const b = document.createElement('button');
    b.innerHTML = '<span class="no">0' + (i + 1) + '</span>' + st.querySelector('h3').textContent;
    b.addEventListener('click', () => st.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' }));
    rail.appendChild(b);
  });
  const btns = [...rail.children];
  const drawFig = (st) => {
    if (st.dataset.drawn) return;
    st.dataset.drawn = '1';
    st.querySelectorAll('.draw .dl').forEach((p, i) => {
      if (!p.getTotalLength) { gsap.from(p, { opacity: 0, duration: .5 }); return; }
      const len = p.getTotalLength();
      p.style.strokeDasharray = String(len); p.style.strokeDashoffset = String(len);
      gsap.to(p, { strokeDashoffset: 0, duration: 1.1, delay: i * .12, ease: 'power2.inOut' });
    });
    gsap.from(st.querySelectorAll('.dotfill,.dotred'), { scale: 0, transformOrigin: 'center',
      duration: .5, stagger: .06, ease: 'back.out(2)' });
  };
  stages.forEach((st, i) => {
    ScrollTrigger.create({ trigger: st, start: 'top 55%', end: 'bottom 45%',
      onToggle: (s) => btns[i].classList.toggle('on', s.isActive), onEnter: () => drawFig(st) });
    if (!RM) gsap.from(st.children, { opacity: 0, y: 24, duration: .7, ease: 'power3.out', stagger: .08,
      scrollTrigger: { trigger: st, start: 'top 78%', once: true } });
  });
}

/* ── 断行劇場（scrub 逐行）── */
const galley = $('#galley'), brkCount = $('#brkCount');
if (galley) {
  const WORDS = (
    '一個 Office 檔案是數千個宣告的容器：引擎未觸碰的每一個宣告、' +
    '每一條 ZIP entry、每一個位元組，都會在寫回時原樣出現。The browser tab and the desktop share one ' +
    'layout core: the same shaped advances, the same optimal breaks, the same display list. One keystroke ' +
    'reflows the dirty interval, not the whole document.').split(/\s+/);
  const N = WORDS.length, lines = [];
  let start = 0;
  const ends = [0.16, 0.33, 0.52, 0.70, 0.87, 1].map(f => Math.round(f * (N - 1)));
  ends.forEach((end, i) => {
    const words = WORDS.slice(start, end + 1).filter(Boolean);
    if (!words.length) return;
    const l = document.createElement('span');
    l.className = 'line';
    l.style.opacity = RM ? '1' : '0.16';
    l.innerHTML = words.join(' ') +
      '<span class="brk">¶</span><span class="badness">break</span>';
    galley.appendChild(l); lines.push(l); start = end + 1;
  });
  if (RM) {
    lines.forEach((l) => l.classList.add('lit'));
    if (brkCount) brkCount.textContent = String(lines.length);
  } else {
    const tl = gsap.timeline({ scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.quire-home .theatre', start: 'top 80', end: 'bottom bottom', scrub: .6 } });
    lines.forEach((l, i) => {
      tl.to(l, { opacity: 1, duration: .55, ease: 'none' }, i * .11);
      tl.call(() => l.classList.add('lit'), null, i * .11 + .2);
    });
    ScrollTrigger.create({ trigger: '.quire-home .theatre', start: 'top 80', end: 'bottom bottom',
      onUpdate: (s) => { if (brkCount) brkCount.textContent = String(Math.max(0, Math.min(lines.length, Math.round(s.progress * lines.length)))); } });
  }
}

/* ── 399 計數滾動 ── */
const c399 = $('#c399');
if (c399 && !RM) {
  ScrollTrigger.create({ trigger: c399, start: 'top 88%', once: true, onEnter: () => {
    gsap.to({ v: 0 }, { v: 399, duration: 1.4, ease: 'power2.out',
      onUpdate() { c399.textContent = String(Math.round(this.targets()[0].v)); } });
  } });
}

/* ── reflow lab ── */
const labText = $('#labtext'), lw = $('#lw'), ls = $('#ls'), lmeta = $('#lmeta');
if (labText && lw && ls && lmeta) {
  let timer = 0;
  const reflow = () => {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = window.setTimeout(() => {
      const t0 = performance.now();
      const lh = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(labText).lineHeight) || 30;
      const lines = Math.round(labText.offsetHeight / lh);
      const ms = (performance.now() - t0).toFixed(1);
      lmeta.innerHTML = 'lines · <b>' + lines + '</b> · relayout read <b>' + ms + ' ms</b>';
    }, 240);
  };
  lw.addEventListener('input', () => { labText.style.width = lw.value + '%'; reflow(); });
  ls.addEventListener('input', () => { labText.style.fontSize = ls.value + 'px'; reflow(); });
  reflow();
}
</script>
